{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026wg7g2zBHEa1794822060.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>受一道冷鋒及東北季候風影響，本港本周中起氣溫下降，周五最低15度。</p><p></p><p>天文台指，一道冷鋒周三稍後橫過華南沿岸，本港北風增強，晚上起氣溫下降，周四市區最低18度，受隨後的強烈東北季候風影響，本周後期廣東地區仍普遍清涼，內陸地區早晚寒冷，本港周五進一步下降至最低15度，至下周一氣溫才稍為回升。</p><p></p><p><a href=\"https://www.hko.gov.hk/tc/wxinfo/currwx/fnd.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">九天天氣預報</a></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-16T10:16:31.648053+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":151,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-16T09:24:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-16T10:29:54.450165+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-16T10:09:41.671486+00:00","content_hash":"31534238d44a2d931fcc7242a21887a69d8a9c01817a1bf0045f81f8b1877f28","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-16T10:16:31.648053+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}